OL,3,GNEWSACouncil 'bypassed' over
OL,4,ACrowborough asylum camp
OL,5,
OL,6,FGovernment plans to extend the use of a
OL,7,Fformer military training camp in East
OL,8,FSussex to house asylum seekers will
OL,9,Fbypass the council, the local authority
OL,10,Fhas claimed.
OL,12,FPlans to use the Crowborough Training
OL,13,FCamp to house up to 540 men were
OL,14,Fannounced last year. The Home Office is
OL,15,Fseeking permission to continue to use
OL,16,Fthe site until 2030.
OL,18,FWealden District Council (WDC) said it
OL,19,Fhad been told that the Home Office
OL,20,Fintended to seek planning permission
OL,21,Fdirectly from the secretary of state,
OL,22,Fbypassing WDC.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
